      <p><seg source="#source-810-867">尊札拝見仕候。寒気之節益御安泰、長途無</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-867-879">二</note><seg source="#source-879-882">御</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-84-77" source="#source-882-956">罣</g><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-956-968">一</note><seg source="#source-968-998">御修業、珍重之御儀奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-998-1010">レ</note><seg source="#source-1010-1028">存候。扨仰被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1028-1040">レ</note><seg source="#source-1040-1061">越候御趣、何レ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1067-1118"><seg source="#source-1061-1067">拝願</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1091-1103">（ママ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1118-1136">之上御相談可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1136-1148">二</note><seg source="#source-1148-1154">申上</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1154-1166">一</note><seg source="#source-1166-1169">奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1169-1181">レ</note><seg source="#source-1181-1202">存候。然ニ奴儀</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1202-1256"><rb><seg source="#source-1205-1208">無</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1208-1220">レ</note><seg source="#source-1220-1223">拠</seg></rb><rt>（よんどころなく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1256-1325">要用ニ相掛居申候間、明後出足ニ而其御許迄参上可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1325-1337">レ</note><seg source="#source-1337-1343">仕奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1343-1355">レ</note><seg source="#source-1355-1370">存候。誠ニ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1373-1421"><seg source="#source-1370-1373">偏</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1394-1406">（ママ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1421-1472">境之地、殊ニ山中御滞留故、御徒然奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1472-1484">レ</note><seg source="#source-1484-1493">察候。</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1493-1528" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1511-1528">恐惶謹言。</seg></seg></p>
